# public/_redirects
# Legacy Route Redirects
#
# Author: Edward Silva
# Creation Date: 10 November, 2026
# Last Update: 10 November, 2026
#
# Sends old URLs to their current pages with a real 301 on Cloudflare Pages. The targets end in a
# slash because the site serves every page as a folder, so a target without one costs a second hop.
#
# File Structure:
# - One rule per line: source, target, status code
#
# Where this file is used within the repository:
# - Astro copies public/ into dist/, and Cloudflare Pages reads dist/_redirects on deploy
# - Not applied by astro dev or astro preview
#
# Usage:
# $ `curl -D - https://dev.edwardasilva.pages.dev/classes` : Shows one 301 to /education/coursework/
#
# Copyright (c) 2026 Edward Silva. All rights reserved.

/experience /experiences/ 301
/experience/ /experiences/ 301
/classes /education/coursework/ 301
/classes/ /education/coursework/ 301
/coursework /education/coursework/ 301
/coursework/ /education/coursework/ 301
/portfolio /projects/ 301
/portfolio/ /projects/ 301
/profile / 301
/profile/ / 301
/resume/viewer.html /resume/viewer/ 301
